## Design System Integration

V1 -> V2 mapping for the progress ring in [`hooks/use-loader-config.ts`](hooks/use-loader-config.ts):

| Slot | V1 token | V2 token |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Track (unfilled portion) | `textTransparentNeutral` | `carbon100` |
| Progress (filled portion) | `textSecondaryNeutral` | `carbon500` |

`customTrackColor` / `customProgressColor` consumer overrides take precedence; the theme tokens are only the default. Figma fallback hex literals (`#F2F2F2`, `#666666`) remain unchanged.
